<title>USA: First Data gets FTC ok on MoneyGram IPO.</title>
<headline>First Data gets FTC ok on MoneyGram IPO.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp said on Tuesday that the Federal Trade Commission has approved its divestiture of MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc through an initial public offering of common stock.</p>
<p>MoneyGram, a Denver-based money transfer services company founded in 1988, will trade on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;MNE,&quot; First Data said.</p>
</text>
